Top<span id="A2.T6.8.1.1" class="ltx_text">-</span>1 accuracy and cyclic shift consistency (integer and half<span id="A2.T6.8.1.2" class="ltx_text">-</span>pixel) on ImageNet.
AvgPool and AFCA retain near<span id="A2.T6.8.1.3" class="ltx_text">-</span>perfect equivariance, while AFCA provides a consistent accuracy gain, most notably for the Small variant.</span></span></figcaption>
