(c) Bilinear fractional shift of 0.5 pixels in horizontal and vertical axes. We use a <math id="A3.F4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="226\times 226" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>226</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>226</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">226\times 226</annotation></semantics></math> center crop of the original <math id="A3.F4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="256\times 256" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">256\times 256</annotation></semantics></math> image and simulate a fractional-pixel shift using a grid-sample with a fractional offset.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
