<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Experiments details</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As mentioned in <a href="#S4" title="4 Experiments ‣ Alias-Free ViT: Fractional Shift Invariance via Linear Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, we used the same training settings as in XCiT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib16" title="" class="ltx_ref">16</a>]</cite>, except for lowering the batch size for the AF model.
We report the used training hyperparameters in <a href="#A4.T8" title="In Appendix D Experiments details ‣ Alias-Free ViT: Fractional Shift Invariance via Linear Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>.</p>
</div>
